<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - BRE-X raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - BRE-X raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lehman Brothers said it upgraded Bre-X Minerals Ltd to buy from neutral on the belief a buyout offer may be very close.</p>
<p>-- In a rpeort, analyst Daniel McCinvey also raised his U.S. price target on the stock to $21 from $16 &quot;and we advise clients to buy Bre-X today.&quot;</p>
<p>-- The stock rose 27/32 to 17-19/32 in U.S. trading.</p>
</text>
